      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "\u2022This paper evaluates the implementation of the MSFD in the Adriatic Sea.\u2022The MSFD is the first policy for marine complex adaptive systems in the EU.\u2022Ecological and jurisdictional boundaries overlap and cross-border cooperation is low.\u2022Integrative assessments of marine systems may be impossible to achieve.\u2022Relative isolation of theoretical approaches and management practices."},
